{"1390970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abstractanks", "steam_appid": 1390970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstractanks is an action-packed real-time-strategy game with an abstract neon theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play <strong>intense multiplayer</strong> skirmishes with up to 16 players or AIs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beat the <strong>short, handcrafted single-player campaign</strong> and master <strong>tough optional challenges</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture spawn circles to quickly produce <strong>hundreds of units</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your map-control to collect and unleash game-changing <strong>power-ups</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Switch the <strong>only unit type</strong> between damage- and utility-mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Climb the leaderboards on <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong> in the endless horde mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Freely <strong>shape your units</strong> into any formation or split units with simple and intuitive controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abstractanks is an action-packed real-time-strategy game with an abstract neon theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play <strong>intense multiplayer</strong> skirmishes with up to 16 players or AIs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beat the <strong>short, handcrafted single-player campaign</strong> and master <strong>tough optional challenges</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture spawn circles to quickly produce <strong>hundreds of units</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your map-control to collect and unleash game-changing <strong>power-ups</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Switch the <strong>only unit type</strong> between damage- and utility-mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Climb the leaderboards on <strong>procedurally generated maps</strong> in the endless horde mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Freely <strong>shape your units</strong> into any formation or split units with simple and intuitive controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Abstractanks is a minimalist RTS game where you control many units of the same type. Focus on map control to access resources because there is no base-building. Play intense skirmishes with up to sixteen teams, where positioning, quick decision-making and a little bit of luck are rewarded.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390970/header.jpg?t=1747902708", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747902708", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747902708", "website": "https://abstractanks.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 620<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stron